WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.600
You're this baby's parent, aren't you?

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.380
Why, you...

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.000
See? You're totally his parent.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ah, so his name is Baby Beel.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:14.920
Great... Now, Gohan-kun...

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:19.770
Use your special move, the Croquette Block!

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:20.960
Furuichi-dono!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.890
Don't, Gohan-kun...

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.090
The way you dug out that spike 
plays right into Count Poo's...

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.560
Please wake up, Furuichi-dono!

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.500
Furuichi-dono, we must make haste!

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.660
What is it?

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.370
Morning already?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.940
'Tis a battle!

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.550
<b>Bravo!</b>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.550
Now, here.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.310
<b>Guts</b>

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.340
You <i>do</i> suit the part.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.720
Let us depart, Furuichi... 
I mean, Adviser Furuichi!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.500
The enemy is at Ishiyama!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.400
Shut the hell up!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.440
Okay. Transferring...

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.280
God, this sucks.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.180
Why is it always me that...

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:25.430
<b>Who Do You 
Think Is Ishiyama's Strongest?</b>

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.590
Oga and Tojo?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.880
Baby Beel! He's back to normal!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:40.070
What the heck's been going on while 
I was dreaming about Gohan-kun?

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.090
Late, aren't we, Furuichi?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.700
Hilda-san!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.580
To think <i>you</i> would be the only one to 
sleep through this important event!

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.080
Didn't you... disappear?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.310
Simpleton.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.200
I simply returned to the Demon 
World to bring back a doctor.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:01.940
Doctor?

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:05.460
Then, that girl is also a Demon?

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.230
Quite a little lady Demon, I'd say...

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.060
So <i>this</i> is Beelze-sama's 
servant in the Human World?

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.090
Gross!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:16.730
This guy's been ogling your thighs 
the whole time, Miss Hilda!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.900
So much for the "lady" part!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.330
And what do you mean, servant?

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:24.310
When exactly did I fall that far, huh?

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.880
You've got it wrong, Lamia.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.150
He is not a servant.

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:30.240
Yeah! You tell her, Miss Hilda!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.130
He's a slave.

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:33.230
Ohh...

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.180
Hey!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:38.500
Anyway, can you explain to me, Hilda-san?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.380
What's going on here?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:45.230
Well, just watch. That's 
why I called you here.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.710
Around here will do, yes?

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.330
My, my... Tojo-san sure 
is a pain, sometimes...

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.810
He says "the one standing 
at the end is the boss."

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.280
but he wants a 1-on-1 with Oga, so we 
have to clear out the distractions.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.010
So, you sure?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.910
Didn't you come here to fight Tojo-san?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:10.450
Indeed, we will bust up Tojo.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.790
Right after we tear your guys apart.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.750
Well that Oga guy ain't 
got a chance against Tojo,

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.970
but he could at least drain 
his stamina, I suppose.

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:25.050
Then you double-team Tojo 
after he's been weakened...

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.430
That's not very sporting.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:30.070
Hey now... Please call 
it, "Using one's head".

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:35.060
Fine, then you used your head. But 
the plan is fundamentally flawed.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.560
You two combined couldn't beat me alone.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.530
Get it?

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.720
Let's hurry up and start fighting!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:51.340
I'm itching to fight you again.

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.700
Put that guy down already, Oga.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.700
Sure.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:03.920
Listen up, Baby Beel. 
This is a 1-on-1 battle.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.960
No one else can interfere.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.380
You understand this, right?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.970
Right! Now sit there and watch closely.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.600
Here we go!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:21.940
You don't learn, do you?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.860
Gonna test your strength 
with mine head-on again?!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.410
A backfist?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.530
Seriously?

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:47.420
Nice! You're the best, really.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.720
Is it over?

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.950
Wow, they're really amazing!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.000
Madame Aoi's awesome, sure...

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.780
But Nene-san is starting to 
feel like she's in command too!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.490
Man, I can sure count on them!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.430
Thanks, you saved me back there.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.370
I had planned on coming alone, but...

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.470
I was reassured when you all came with me.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:23.250
You shouldn't overdo it, Madame Aoi.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.160
Remember, I haven't accepted it yet.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.630
I haven't accepted you leaving the Red Tails.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.810
Nene...

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.890
Now then, shall we go watch Oga vs. Tojo?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.620
Yes... I wonder how that's going?

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:43.770
Why, you...

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.690
Kanzaki-san!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.970
Stay back!

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:49.240
This is between me and him.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.970
I won't forgive you for butting in!

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:55.760
Enough already. You two are weak.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.080
Just accept it and take it easy...

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.840
You have to realize it yourselves.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.670
People without any real power are 
set up at the top as figureheads.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.940
That happens all the time.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.530
Nothing will come from 
being stubborn about it.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.780
Yes, yes... It's actually a chance for you!

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.720
No more targets on your backs any longer...

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:23.500
You need to be thankful to Oga-chan 
for scraping off that false coating...

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.730
You bastards!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.230
Shiroyama!

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.980
It's you assholes who don't understand!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.990
Indeed.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.490
Our stubbornness is what's 
gotten us this far!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.530
Having a target on you 
makes you a bigger man.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:47.360
Although we both had parental connections...

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.790
Very melodramatic.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:55.260
When did you two get so passionate?

00:08:55.960 --> 00:09:00.880
I took a look around everywhere, but this 
was definitely the most interesting.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:02.380
Natsume?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.960
Now... Shall we start the counterattack?

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.600
So these are those "fireworks" 
things they used before...

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.040
I wish Beelze-sama could see them 
now that he's feeling better.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.790
What? There's still one shot...

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.660
Madame, hurry, quickly! Over here!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:33.200
Right.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.040
What is this guy?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:07.980
Come on!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:12.840
He's not just strong... He's 
almost like some beast!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:18.570
Don't get ahead of yourself, you jerk!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:26.910
That was...

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.250
Zebel...

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.030
Crap!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.410
Watch out!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.280
Oga!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.750
Whoa... What the hell are you?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.500
That mark...

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:40.260
Baby Beel!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:45.510
I told you... not to get in the way!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:53.150
What the hell. You kiddin' me? 
You think I was gonna lose?

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.930
I ain't gonna lose. No matter what.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.170
What are you saying? Are 
you some kind of idiot?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.760
Whose sake was it for that 
we came all this way, huh?

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.520
Don't go cutting the link we 
worked so hard to reconnect!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:22.050
How dare you!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.330
Who are you?

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:26.900
And besides, you were getting the 
snot beat out of you back there!

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.810
This isn't a bragging competition!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.810
Without Beelze-sama's power, 
there's no way you can win!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:36.170
She's right, Oga.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.880
You should've realized this 
the last time you fought.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.650
Tojo's a monster!

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.030
He ain't someone you can 
beat fair and square!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:49.170
Well, I don't think telling 
him will change anything.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.870
How long has it been since 
I've seen Oga like this?

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:58.670
Don't make me say it again. This guy is mine.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.090
I don't want you butting in.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:10.130
Besides... Even without this, 
I'm not going anywhere.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:22.280
Incredible! Is something 
like that even possible?

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.530
This is unexpected.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:30.200
For Beelze-sama to erase the 
Zebel Spell of his own free will,

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.750
means that the Master is 
taking a terrible risk.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.540
In other words,

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.750
they've gone beyond a contract between the 
two, and now have a relationship built on trust.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.500
Master...

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:46.390
But wait, wait! What about Tojo then?

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:48.010
I saw it back then...

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.990
I'm pretty sure that was a Zebel Spell!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.470
Don't tell me that he's got 
his own Demon with him, right?

00:13:56.470 --> 00:14:00.060
And is that thing on Tojo's 
shoulder even still there?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.240
Maybe it disappeared?

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.460
Which is it?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:08.610
Sorry for making you wait. 
Now, let's continue!

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.260
That mark from before... That explains it.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.120
It's proof that you're strong.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:19.370
Nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.750
Right! Let's finish this!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:07.190
Damn him... After all this, he's 
taken his power to another level...

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:10.610
He was about to keel over before...

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:12.510
Where the hell is he getting the energy?

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:18.740
But even so... I'll be the one to win!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.660
I won!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:47.160
I looked up to him.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:54.840
I was raised in a dump of a 
city, surrounded by human trash.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:59.540
Tora, don't go underestimating us adults now.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.940
Grabbin' our shop's money, are we?

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.780
I told you, it wasn't me!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.110
It was you!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.900
Who else would it be, huh?

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:12.530
A world where power was everything, 
and the weak were crushed underfoot.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.910
That's why I felt like I had to get strong.

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.090
Fighting a kid? That's not cool.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.450
Like him...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.090
H-He did it!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.660
Oga... beat Tojo!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:54.540
Finally, he's risen to the top of Ishiyama!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.150
Why?

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:10.950
After you talked to that baby, 
and the mark disappeared,

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.720
your punches suddenly got heavier.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.620
It shouldn't be like that.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.430
That's a mark that proves 
you're the strongest.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:24.060
I can't believe that having it 
vanish could make you stronger.

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.440
I don't know what you're talking about,

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.910
but I promised him that I wouldn't lose.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:32.940
That's all.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.030
A promise?

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:43.880
Tora.

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.070
Listen up, Tora.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:53.670
True strength isn't about beating 
someone. It's about protecting someone.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.890
You said you wanted to get 
strong like me one day...

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:02.410
No matter how strong you get 
or how many battles you fight,

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:06.450
without that, you'll never win a true battle.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.120
No matter what.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.200
The difference is what we 
were trying to protect...

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.020
I won.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.640
My, my...

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:41.500
I suppose we've reached a new milestone.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.300
Aren't you going to go bandage 
his wounds, Madame Aoi?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.570
What are you saying? Of course not!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.940
All that matters is that he won.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:58.890
I'm going home.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.580
Hey...

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.990
Because... If I went to him now...

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.790
I'd just be in the way, you know?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.520
What a woman.

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:13.940
Oga!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:15.480
What is it, Furuichi?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:16.660
You came?

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.430
Anyway, as you can see, I paid him back.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.650
Are you a complete idiot?! What 
the hell were you thinking?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:27.860
Haven't you forgotten 
something very important?!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.440
The Zebel Spell!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.940
Tojo-san, may I ask you about 
the mark on your shoulder?

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.030
You're the idiot.  Let's go.

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:46.330
A long time ago, I had a man I looked up to.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:56.340
I copied him and got this tatoo 
trying to look like him.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:01.650
Then that means... There's someone else 
other than Oga who has a contract?

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:07.470
I remembered when I saw that 
mark glowing on your fist.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.980
It was just like him.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:13.240
He also did some crazy unbelievable stuff.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:16.870
You're different than me. 
You're the real deal.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:21.590
Oga... You're the strongest at Ishiyama!

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:00.730
So Oga is Ishiyama's strongest...

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.440
I guess that's a good thing.

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:12.060
Although my arm feels like 
it's going to explode!

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:18.560
What the...?! Eww! Stay back!

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:23.350
Oh, no! The master is over-excited!

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:29.070
He's injecting all that magic power 
he's built up into that right arm...

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:31.190
You must hurry and release it!

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:32.580
It'll burst open!

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.010
Release the energy?

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.960
Whatever, just punch something!

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:40.250
God damn it...!

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:18.250
Um... I am now standing before 
an unbelievable sight.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:22.750
This is Ishiyama High School, famous 
locally as a school for delinquents.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.980
Or rather, this <i>was</i> Ishiyama High School.

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:30.100
What in the world could have 
happened here the previous night?

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:36.470
According to neighborhood witnesses, a 
number of delinquents gathered here last night.

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.870
That school you now control is being shown.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:03.430
You finally did it, Oga Tatsumi!

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:05.730
Yes, I finally did.

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:09.630
But our battle has only yet begun!

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:12.630
I must undergo special training 
to prepare for my next battle!

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.150
That's right, Baby Beel!

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:17.550
We'll slather honey on a chestnut 
tree and lie in ambush!

00:24:17.550 --> 00:24:20.640
Your next enemy is a stag beetle?

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:23.370
On the next Beelzebub: 
Secluded Mountain Training!

00:24:23.370 --> 00:24:27.820
Secluded mountains... At a 
temple that my grandpa knows?!
